00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,786
The product has the opposite configuration.

2
00:00:02,786 --> 00:00:08,203
This is Walden inversion, the proof of the S N two mechanism.

3
00:00:08,203 --> 00:00:17,291
Because both the haloalkane and the nucleophile are in the single step, the rate equals k times both concentrations: second order.

